pi.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98866","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98866","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98866.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98866.patch","merged_at":"2024-11-10T18:19:42Z"},"body":"Improves navigation map sync performance by avoiding unnecessary memory allocations.\r\n\r\n- Edges were still using old CoW Vectors.\r\n- Map sync was creating new HashMaps / LocalVectors for every build data instead of reusing.\r\n\r\nIn a large test project this change dropped the sync time from ~400.000 usec down to ~300.000 usec.\r\nRoughly a 20-30% improvement on average in the projects I tried.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":